      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:715722c53b815d851adcb4f8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看完今天的比赛，我确定了一件事。\n第一红宝石她──",
      "source_fingerprint": "a083c9a0ff1dad397e4dcfe2cff0e8f3d30221854eac0181118fabc4e82076ce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81e0ab864d742048a59ba7a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从那让人看得七上八下的表现，\n以及赛后的强烈疲劳，能确定她在\n“赛马娘赛”展现的速度才是她的本领──",
      "source_fingerprint": "89abe66ea725ef04169ca3adcee18fb79a1b41dbe51cd25897d7dd3f3717b5a9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24b14b06f8ddf2fc45882536",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（是该重视她的意愿，或是……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "30bf098420e7bcb7653c5004acb12a7eb3cc551ea0e76b225f9def5e8a968dfa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8587535f7928c67f37d8ef2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且她本人也已理解到这一点。\n不过，她大概不打算因此放弃主流路线。\n我这个训练员到底该怎么做才好……",
      "source_fingerprint": "252e1e40f698acfbe5a978c45d1274af6114a3b0bda28b89ddf26caa747d3433",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff2a5e46a162bcb82e921366",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“秋华赏”的场地为2000米，\n这个程度的距离或许还有希望。\n我得在夏季集训的锻炼期间谨慎思考了──",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f74b4b9459e9b59e44103c5f12b75e73be9d83532c67958bd1555c28dbc459d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b972836bcc9a81c73cd732e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49672a086a169b187b16a389c63cf25fceada147d32b3aa866520c2b922fd86c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f72044e72c517bcfb4dc840",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6315497a6fb0538f36cc68cceef53a4880b3277bf37aedecbd0be6c79bfe3fbb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
